## Model card

- **Name:** Iceman
- **Short description:** OpenCode's anonymous stealth reasoning model offered as a free text model on OpenCode Console/Go, with large context for coding/prototyping workflows (per local metadata and OpenCode docs).
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Console inference (`opencode/iceman-free`), OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint per OpenCode docs; free-tier access subject to OpenCode terms.
- **Release / knowledge:** Stealth/anonymous model; release date and knowledge cutoff not publicly disclosed in verified sources reviewed.
- **IDs:** `opencode/iceman-free` (free ID available).
- **Context window:** 262,144 input / 131,072 output tokens (per local meta).
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out (per local meta).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Free on OpenCode for a limited time; OpenCode states prompts/completions are retained and used to improve the model during the free period.
- **Architecture:** Not publicly disclosed (stealth model).

